{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上方第一块超大号白色文字，第一眼先落在“明知道回去未必找得回那份亲近，他却还是忍不住想：万一能呢？”；随后视线容易被下方另一块同样醒目的大字吸引。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"他明知回去未必能找回过去的亲近，却仍忍不住期待还有可能。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"留恋、不甘心、抱有侥幸希望。\",\n  \"missed\": \"他正在尝试不再依赖回头的希望，而是先把眼下日子过稳；即使仍然害怕、没有底气，也不打算收回向前走的决定。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"两块同样显眼的大字争夺主视线，第一眼容易先抓到回头的念头，却不容易确定这一屏最终想表达的方向。\",\n    \"第二块大字单块较长，包含忍让、稳定生活、独自承担、害怕和坚持等多层意思。\",\n    \"核心意思分散在两块大字里，需要把前面的留恋和后面的向前走拼起来，才能理解处境与感受之间的完整关系。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 2\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "db90b663-3458-41cb-890a-01d9e763685b", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261110T013639355190Z", "elapsed_seconds": 22.016, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T01:37:01.385072+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "77005f145de410482426d310337dcf9be85c2b807fc958f9d07cad7ebe7e5ce8", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f66